1.1.0 (2025-06-24)
===========
Use SemVer for version comparison instead of PHP version_compare
Allow plugin or site owner to upgrade to prereleases
Ignore "v" at the start of version numbers
Support paginatinon with GitHub API calls
Support autoloading

1.0.2 (2024-09-23)
==================
Allow the "Check again." force-check to bypass cache.
Allow plugin to override transient cache timeout

